### Demostración del vertical slice "Asignar repartidor" (Actividad 4)
### Requisitos: `docker compose up -d` y `dotnet run --project src/LogiTracker.Api`.
### En VS Code se ejecuta con la extensión REST Client (clic en "Send Request").
### Repartidores de demostración: Ana (3/5), Luis (1/5), Sofia (5/5, saturada), Pedro (fuera de turno).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5125
@apiKey = dev-key-marta-0001
@ana = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@luis = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@sofia = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@pedro = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### 0. Salud del sistema (sin autenticación)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Sin clave de API -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/couriers

### 2. Repartidores con su turno y su carga
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/couriers
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 3. Pedido listo para logística -> crea la entrega (201). Repetirlo devuelve la misma entrega (200).
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{$guid}}",
  "address": { "street": "Calle 10 # 20-30", "city": "Bogota", "postalCode": "110111" },
  "windowStart": "2026-11-02T14:00:00-05:00",
  "windowEnd": "2026-11-02T18:00:00-05:00",
  "packageCount": 2
}

@deliveryId = {{create.response.body.$.deliveryId}}

### 4. ESC-05: Sofia tiene la ruta saturada -> 422 courier_capacity_reached
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assignment
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "{{sofia}}" }

### 5. ESC-04: Pedro está fuera de turno -> 422 courier_unavailable
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assignment
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "{{pedro}}" }

### 6. ESC-01: asignar a Ana -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assignment
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "{{ana}}" }

### 7. ESC-03: reintento con Ana -> 200 sin duplicar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assignment
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "{{ana}}" }

### 8. ESC-02: intentar con Luis -> 409 delivery_already_assigned
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assignment
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "{{luis}}" }

### 9. Consultar estado e historial (assignedBy = operadora autenticada)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 10. ESC-11: liberar sin motivo -> 400 release_reason_required
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assignment/release
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "" }

### 11. ESC-10: liberar con motivo -> 200, vuelve a pendiente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assignment/release
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Vehiculo averiado" }

### ---------- Fallas controladas (solo en desarrollo) ----------

### 12. Simular caída de la fuente de disponibilidad
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/dev/faults
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "availabilityDown": true, "notificationFault": "None" }

### 13. ESC-09: asignar con la fuente caída -> 503 + Retry-After, la entrega sigue pendiente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assignment
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "{{luis}}" }

### 14. Simular que el proveedor de notificaciones rechaza los mensajes
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/dev/faults
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "availabilityDown": false, "notificationFault": "Permanent" }

### 15. Asignar: la asignación se confirma (200) aunque el aviso falle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assignment
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "{{luis}}" }

### 16. El aviso fallido quedó apartado en la DLQ (esperar ~2 s)
# @name deadLetters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox/dead-letters
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 17. Corregir la causa (proveedor de nuevo disponible)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/dev/faults
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "availabilityDown": false, "notificationFault": "None" }

### 18. Reprocesar el aviso apartado -> 202 (luego la DLQ queda vacía)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox/dead-letters/{{deadLetters.response.body.$[0].id}}/requeue
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
